1
00:01:31,450 --> 00:01:34,576
"Doing Whatever You Want with the Magic Hand"

2
00:01:39,922 --> 00:01:43,229
Awesome, it's the comic I've always wanted!

3
00:01:44,363 --> 00:01:46,109
Looks pretty interesting

4
00:01:46,323 --> 00:01:48,042
Gian, no!

5
00:01:48,083 --> 00:01:49,933
I bought this comic with my own money!

6
00:01:50,923 --> 00:01:52,963
What's yours is Gian's!

7
00:01:53,003 --> 00:01:55,064
And what's mine is mine!

8
00:01:56,179 --> 00:01:57,798
How can you do that?

9
00:02:01,083 --> 00:02:02,556
Poor Nobita

10
00:02:02,683 --> 00:02:05,737
He's practically the most pitiful boy in the world!

11
00:02:09,842 --> 00:02:11,202
And that's what happened

12
00:02:11,242 --> 00:02:13,786
Is there any way to help this poor boy?

13
00:02:14,523 --> 00:02:16,082
That's so ridiculous

14
00:02:16,123 --> 00:02:18,897
Besides, it's not even snowing right now!

15
00:02:19,163 --> 00:02:21,387
It's just to express how I felt back then

16
00:02:21,677 --> 00:02:24,190
Getting my comic stolen really did happen!

17
00:02:24,243 --> 00:02:27,153
Then I'll just help you get your comic back

18
00:02:30,283 --> 00:02:32,057
"Magic Hand"

19
00:02:33,334 --> 00:02:36,459
Remember, you can't use this gadget to do bad things!

20
00:02:36,662 --> 00:02:38,402
Yeah, yeah, I know

21
00:02:38,442 --> 00:02:39,536
I'm off!

22
00:02:42,029 --> 00:02:43,908
Is this really going to be okay?

23
00:02:46,003 --> 00:02:48,439
Let's see, where is Gian?

24
00:02:52,652 --> 00:02:56,325
Such an interesting comic is totally wasted on Nobita

25
00:02:57,723 --> 00:02:58,853
All right

26
00:03:02,269 --> 00:03:03,892
Grabbed the wrong one

27
00:03:04,443 --> 00:03:05,879
Where is it?

28
00:03:07,723 --> 00:03:09,405
Darn that Gian!

29
00:03:09,723 --> 00:03:11,490
Take this!

30
00:03:16,683 --> 00:03:17,695
Take this!

31
00:03:20,412 --> 00:03:21,549
Who's there?

32
00:03:23,245 --> 00:03:25,967
It really felt like someone was twisting my ear just now

33
00:03:26,964 --> 00:03:28,250
Whatever, then

34
00:03:31,397 --> 00:03:32,496
Who is that?!

35
00:03:37,333 --> 00:03:38,594
What's going on?!

36
00:03:51,913 --> 00:03:53,777
Total success!

37
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,768
Seems like you went a bit too far

38
00:03:57,822 --> 00:03:58,854
Doraemon

39
00:03:58,895 --> 00:04:00,630
Take the comic home for me

40
00:04:01,204 --> 00:04:03,263
I'm going to have some fun with these gloves before heading back

41
00:04:03,592 --> 00:04:04,952
That's way too much!

42
00:04:04,993 --> 00:04:06,296
You always do this, Nobita!

43
00:04:06,337 --> 00:04:07,258
Whenever you get carried away...

44
00:04:07,298 --> 00:04:09,325
You always end up doing bad things!

45
00:04:09,659 --> 00:04:11,774
Don't be mad, don't be mad

46
00:04:11,932 --> 00:04:15,522
*Tickle*...

47
00:04:15,563 --> 00:04:18,375
Don't try to distract me! Give them back right now!

48
00:04:20,186 --> 00:04:22,327
Give them back right now! Ow...

49
00:04:23,465 --> 00:04:24,600
Give them back right now!

50
00:04:25,545 --> 00:04:28,714
I really, really don't like your tone

51
00:04:29,702 --> 00:04:31,229
So I'm not giving them back to you

52
00:04:31,784 --> 00:04:33,145
Wait up!

53
00:04:36,528 --> 00:04:39,116
If you dare, just try coming over!

54
00:04:51,933 --> 00:04:53,952
That's so mean!

55
00:04:54,835 --> 00:04:56,666
This looks so realistic

56
00:04:56,770 --> 00:04:58,933
Nobody would ever believe it's fake

57
00:04:59,717 --> 00:05:01,798
Let's go test it on Nobita right away

58
00:05:01,838 --> 00:05:04,334
Let's have you try it out first!

59
00:05:11,442 --> 00:05:13,594
Th-This...

60
00:05:19,268 --> 00:05:21,056
It's a real snake!

61
00:05:21,097 --> 00:05:23,499
Help me, Mom!

62
00:05:24,765 --> 00:05:26,723
That's what you get for doing that to me!

63
00:05:30,097 --> 00:05:32,429
Found you! Give the Magic Hand back!

64
00:05:32,514 --> 00:05:35,083
What? Right when it's getting fun!

65
00:05:35,124 --> 00:05:36,083
Darn it!

66
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:45,643
Where would you like to go, passenger?

67
00:05:46,001 --> 00:05:48,062
I didn't want a ride!

68
00:05:49,388 --> 00:05:50,521
Hang on tight!

69
00:05:52,715 --> 00:05:53,964
That takes care of that

70
00:05:54,514 --> 00:05:57,071
Oh right, it'd be nice to go show Shizuka

71
00:06:00,999 --> 00:06:02,527
I'm so sorry!

72
00:06:02,618 --> 00:06:03,747
Nobita!

73
00:06:03,788 --> 00:06:05,042
Oh, again?

74
00:06:05,474 --> 00:06:07,419
I'll never forgive you!

75
00:06:12,655 --> 00:06:14,346
Do you want to help me carry this?

76
00:06:15,128 --> 00:06:16,858
- Yes
- Really?

77
00:06:16,919 --> 00:06:20,718
- Kids these days are so kindhearted
- It's nothing, really

78
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:26,033
My, that really deserves praise

79
00:06:26,410 --> 00:06:27,858
You've gone too far!

80
00:06:34,151 --> 00:06:36,228
It's a bit too early to use it now

81
00:06:38,604 --> 00:06:40,744
What is Shizuka doing?

82
00:06:43,975 --> 00:06:45,134
I get it!

83
00:06:45,175 --> 00:06:47,704
She really wants to try her mom's makeup

84
00:06:48,136 --> 00:06:50,520
In that case, let me help her out!

85
00:06:58,066 --> 00:06:59,114
Why?

86
00:06:59,453 --> 00:07:01,477
This is harder than I thought!

87
00:07:01,518 --> 00:07:03,774
No matter what, I have to make Shizuka pretty!

88
00:07:19,532 --> 00:07:20,556
Sorry!

89
00:07:21,412 --> 00:07:24,223
Shizuka really looks better without makeup after all

90
00:07:25,251 --> 00:07:27,478
She's cute enough just the way she normally is

91
00:07:28,415 --> 00:07:29,392
Really?

92
00:07:29,458 --> 00:07:32,040
Your son's blind date didn't go well yesterday?

93
00:07:32,086 --> 00:07:33,137
Yeah

94
00:07:33,495 --> 00:07:36,135
But these things come down to fate in the end

95
00:07:36,176 --> 00:07:38,936
I'm sure your son will find a great match

96
00:07:43,496 --> 00:07:44,624
Why is this happening?

97
00:07:47,637 --> 00:07:49,389
Ma'am, what are you doing?

98
00:07:49,979 --> 00:07:51,435
It's my body!

99
00:07:56,185 --> 00:07:57,731
I'm so tired!

100
00:07:58,978 --> 00:08:02,223
I'm sorry, my body's moving on its own!

101
00:08:03,695 --> 00:08:05,562
This is getting way out of hand!

102
00:08:07,574 --> 00:08:09,544
Now I have no choice but to use that method

103
00:08:11,455 --> 00:08:13,642
Pulling such an outrageous prank...

104
00:08:13,988 --> 00:08:15,700
It has to be you, Nobita!

105
00:08:15,741 --> 00:08:16,918
That's right, exactly!

106
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,165
How horrible!

107
00:08:19,036 --> 00:08:20,558
It wasn't me!

108
00:08:20,618 --> 00:08:22,838
I'll definitely catch you red-handed!

109
00:08:25,053 --> 00:08:26,805
The Magic Hand is used from far away

110
00:08:26,846 --> 00:08:28,524
so no one can catch me

111
00:08:31,430 --> 00:08:32,830
Ouch!

112
00:08:38,093 --> 00:08:39,476
How could this be?

113
00:08:39,694 --> 00:08:41,736
(Magic Butt)

114
00:08:42,312 --> 00:08:44,009
This is the Magic Butt

115
00:08:44,213 --> 00:08:45,088
As long as you hit this

116
00:08:45,129 --> 00:08:47,608
you can punish them no matter where they are

117
00:08:49,252 --> 00:08:51,168
This is punishment for your pranks!

118
00:08:51,412 --> 00:08:52,283
Nobita!

119
00:09:01,666 --> 00:09:04,076
"Snake-Headed Monster"

120
00:09:06,543 --> 00:09:08,770
I'm home!

121
00:09:09,141 --> 00:09:10,807
You're back?

122
00:09:13,658 --> 00:09:16,086
What's wrong? You can't even stand properly?

123
00:09:16,191 --> 00:09:17,894
Massage my legs for me

124
00:09:22,952 --> 00:09:23,948
What's the matter with you?

125
00:09:23,989 --> 00:09:26,613
Why should I massage your legs?

126
00:09:27,219 --> 00:09:29,849
Because I was made to stand all day at school

127
00:09:29,889 --> 00:09:32,135
so my legs are exhausted now

128
00:09:32,488 --> 00:09:34,327
If that's the case, you should be more careful

129
00:09:34,367 --> 00:09:36,415
and not get punished by the teacher

130
00:09:36,486 --> 00:09:38,027
That's impossible

131
00:09:38,885 --> 00:09:40,439
I'm fully confident

132
00:09:40,604 --> 00:09:42,975
that I'll still forget my homework in the future

133
00:09:43,126 --> 00:09:45,351
and fall asleep during class, too

134
00:09:46,801 --> 00:09:49,149
Why be so confident about something so shameful?

135
00:09:49,394 --> 00:09:53,388
So give me a gadget that won't make me tired when standing for punishment

136
00:09:55,322 --> 00:09:57,175
You're hopeless...

137
00:09:58,483 --> 00:10:00,735
"Snake-Headed Monster"

138
00:10:01,971 --> 00:10:04,517
What's this box with a snake head?

139
00:10:04,604 --> 00:10:05,992
Li... Listen to me

140
00:10:06,033 --> 00:10:08,241
This is an extremely terrifying gadget

141
00:10:09,762 --> 00:10:13,136
So you must use it very carefully, okay?

142
00:10:14,467 --> 00:10:16,563
The beam of light emitted from its eyes

143
00:10:16,708 --> 00:10:19,029
can completely harden a creature's muscles

144
00:10:19,069 --> 00:10:21,543
turning them just like stone

145
00:10:24,203 --> 00:10:27,009
I don't want such a scary gadget!

146
00:10:27,082 --> 00:10:29,155
It's fine, if you use it carefully

147
00:10:29,195 --> 00:10:31,118
it's actually a very handy gadget

148
00:10:31,722 --> 00:10:33,147
Really?

149
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:36,385
Now, aim it at your legs

150
00:10:36,425 --> 00:10:38,447
and slowly open the lid

151
00:10:53,836 --> 00:10:55,521
I... I can't move them!

152
00:10:55,748 --> 00:10:58,027
My legs have turned to stone!

153
00:10:58,356 --> 00:11:00,003
See, isn't that perfect?

154
00:11:00,143 --> 00:11:03,573
With stone legs, you won't get tired no matter how long you stand

155
00:11:07,542 --> 00:11:08,770
Hey, you're right

156
00:11:08,811 --> 00:11:11,483
In that case, even standing for days would be fine

157
00:11:11,590 --> 00:11:14,397
All you have to do is pull its snake-like hair

158
00:11:19,590 --> 00:11:21,386
and it'll turn back to normal

159
00:11:23,714 --> 00:11:26,673
Great, then I'll take it to school tomorrow

160
00:11:27,973 --> 00:11:30,218
Is getting punished really something to look forward to?

161
00:11:32,861 --> 00:11:35,370
Nobita, go stand in the hallway!

162
00:11:35,411 --> 00:11:36,297
Yes, sir

163
00:11:37,423 --> 00:11:38,992
This is so easy

164
00:11:39,972 --> 00:11:42,962
It feels just like sitting on a rock

165
00:11:43,484 --> 00:11:45,602
There are plenty of other uses too

166
00:11:45,911 --> 00:11:49,285
Like turning everyone I hate into stone

167
00:11:49,503 --> 00:11:51,667
Though doing that isn't very nice, is it?

168
00:11:51,745 --> 00:11:53,205
Why not harden my fists

169
00:11:53,245 --> 00:11:55,073
and go teach Gian a lesson?

170
00:11:55,114 --> 00:11:57,099
He'll definitely be seeing stars!

171
00:11:57,365 --> 00:11:59,317
That would feel so satisfying

172
00:12:00,021 --> 00:12:01,771
Just thinking about it makes me happy

173
00:12:03,653 --> 00:12:04,605
Nobita

174
00:12:04,877 --> 00:12:06,435
Uh... Sir?

175
00:12:06,476 --> 00:12:08,993
Do you think being punished to stand is fun?

176
00:12:09,223 --> 00:12:11,096
No, of course not

177
00:12:11,985 --> 00:12:14,428
Stay standing here until school ends!

178
00:12:15,918 --> 00:12:17,344
Just keep standing then!

179
00:12:27,110 --> 00:12:29,285
I got chewed out by the teacher, too

180
00:12:29,432 --> 00:12:30,625
-Nobita
-Yes, sir

181
00:12:31,553 --> 00:12:33,061
Let me remind you again

182
00:12:33,113 --> 00:12:35,234
Make sure you finish your sketch homework

183
00:12:35,274 --> 00:12:36,352
Right... okay

184
00:12:36,875 --> 00:12:38,085
Goodbye

185
00:12:39,112 --> 00:12:40,546
So frustrating!

186
00:12:43,798 --> 00:12:45,333
What is this?

187
00:12:46,649 --> 00:12:48,570
I'm back

188
00:12:49,899 --> 00:12:51,255
I'm exhausted

189
00:12:52,575 --> 00:12:54,435
Massage my legs

190
00:12:54,593 --> 00:12:55,563
Huh?

191
00:12:55,604 --> 00:12:58,347
Didn't you use the Snake-Headed Monster today?

192
00:13:01,576 --> 00:13:03,665
I forgot to bring it back!

193
00:13:05,495 --> 00:13:08,114
I accidentally left it at school

194
00:13:08,155 --> 00:13:09,437
Oh no, this is bad!

195
00:13:09,515 --> 00:13:12,619
Anyone who gets close turns into stone!

196
00:13:12,688 --> 00:13:13,952
What are we going to do?

197
00:13:16,032 --> 00:13:17,240
Honestly, so annoying!

198
00:13:17,472 --> 00:13:20,990
Who left this kind of junk in the hallway?

199
00:13:24,660 --> 00:13:26,490
What on earth is this?

200
00:13:27,632 --> 00:13:30,365
Looks like there's something inside

201
00:13:38,504 --> 00:13:39,652
That sound just now...

202
00:13:39,793 --> 00:13:41,716
It's the Snake-Headed Monster!

203
00:13:41,866 --> 00:13:44,008
It came from behind the school

204
00:13:44,048 --> 00:13:45,288
Whoa, could it be...

205
00:13:45,545 --> 00:13:46,508
Let's go check

206
00:13:54,551 --> 00:13:55,623
Teacher!

207
00:13:57,870 --> 00:13:59,610
Teacher has turned into stone!

208
00:13:59,742 --> 00:14:01,773
The Snake-Headed Monster did this

209
00:14:01,814 --> 00:14:03,488
In that case, where's the Snake-Headed Monster?

210
00:14:04,791 --> 00:14:05,568
It...

211
00:14:05,949 --> 00:14:08,543
got out of the box and went off somewhere

212
00:14:09,462 --> 00:14:11,032
Even though it's slow

213
00:14:11,261 --> 00:14:13,861
it can still crawl around anywhere

214
00:14:14,158 --> 00:14:15,643
Then what should we do?

215
00:14:18,730 --> 00:14:20,222
The sound of the Snake-Headed Monster!

216
00:14:20,773 --> 00:14:22,665
It seems to have headed up the back hill

217
00:14:24,578 --> 00:14:25,681
Let's go check it out

218
00:14:35,354 --> 00:14:36,713
What are you doing here?

219
00:14:40,533 --> 00:14:41,966
I'm so sorry!

220
00:14:42,191 --> 00:14:43,398
More importantly

221
00:14:43,570 --> 00:14:45,805
here are crawl tracks from the Snake-Headed Monster

222
00:14:47,883 --> 00:14:50,973
We have to track it without letting it notice us

223
00:14:54,529 --> 00:14:55,699
Be careful

224
00:14:55,809 --> 00:14:57,967
We might bump into it along the way

225
00:15:08,056 --> 00:15:09,160
What's wrong?

226
00:15:09,428 --> 00:15:11,701
The Snake-Headed Monster's tracks vanished!

227
00:15:11,957 --> 00:15:14,361
Watch out, it's right nearby!

228
00:15:20,065 --> 00:15:22,651
Awesome, I caught the Snake-Headed Monster!

229
00:15:23,453 --> 00:15:25,714
-Hooray, hooray!
-Hooray, hooray!

230
00:15:29,707 --> 00:15:30,786
You two!

231
00:15:30,826 --> 00:15:32,077
What are you doing?

232
00:15:32,425 --> 00:15:33,883
-Ouch!
-Ouch!

233
00:15:34,584 --> 00:15:36,343
What are you guys doing here?

234
00:15:36,383 --> 00:15:38,143
Doing our sketch homework, obviously

235
00:15:38,183 --> 00:15:39,142
That's right

236
00:15:40,771 --> 00:15:42,947
I forgot to do my homework!

237
00:15:44,990 --> 00:15:47,705
What? Something that scary escaped?

238
00:15:47,875 --> 00:15:50,748
If we don't catch it soon, it's going to be a disaster!

239
00:15:50,895 --> 00:15:52,343
You guys help out too

240
00:15:52,416 --> 00:15:53,706
That's not my problem

241
00:15:54,336 --> 00:15:56,107
This is your responsibility, Nobita

242
00:15:56,177 --> 00:15:58,138
Go catch it all by yourself

243
00:15:58,178 --> 00:15:59,345
Hmph, ridiculous

244
00:15:59,406 --> 00:16:02,699
But we don't even know where it's hiding

245
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:05,701
Hmph, you think that's going to scare me?

246
00:16:05,741 --> 00:16:07,001
Anyway...

247
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:15,509
The birds have all turned rock-hard!

248
00:16:15,549 --> 00:16:17,151
Calm down, Suneo

249
00:16:18,306 --> 00:16:20,645
Let's work together to catch the Snake-Headed Monster

250
00:16:21,986 --> 00:16:24,675
However, approaching it recklessly is very dangerous

251
00:16:24,784 --> 00:16:26,624
It might turn us into stone

252
00:16:26,664 --> 00:16:28,070
Can it really do that?

253
00:16:28,152 --> 00:16:29,852
Then what should we do?

254
00:16:30,016 --> 00:16:32,588
Let's come up with a plan together first

255
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:36,246
First, we lure the Snake-Headed Monster out

256
00:16:36,286 --> 00:16:38,815
Then we drop this box from above to catch it

257
00:16:39,405 --> 00:16:41,474
Alright, leave trapping it to me

258
00:16:41,605 --> 00:16:42,965
That's Gian for you!

259
00:16:43,004 --> 00:16:44,537
You guys be the bait

260
00:16:45,570 --> 00:16:47,442
That sounds kind of terrifying

261
00:16:47,483 --> 00:16:48,253
Alright

262
00:16:48,323 --> 00:16:51,201
I'll be the bait and lure the Snake-Headed Monster out

263
00:16:51,242 --> 00:16:53,360
But if the Snake-Headed Monster's beam hits you...

264
00:16:53,421 --> 00:16:55,882
No problem, as long as we use this

265
00:16:58,529 --> 00:17:00,359
"Ordinary Mirror"

266
00:17:02,374 --> 00:17:04,128
Now isn't the time to joke around

267
00:17:04,168 --> 00:17:05,618
Can you be serious for once?

268
00:17:05,767 --> 00:17:07,180
I am being serious

269
00:17:07,427 --> 00:17:10,530
We can use this mirror to reflect the Snake-Headed Monster's beam

270
00:17:10,645 --> 00:17:11,724
Oh, right

271
00:17:11,765 --> 00:17:15,406
Then when the Snake-Headed Monster gets hit by its own
beam, it'll turn to stone

272
00:17:15,483 --> 00:17:16,733
I see!

273
00:17:16,962 --> 00:17:18,002
Everyone wait here

274
00:17:18,043 --> 00:17:20,445
until I lure it out

275
00:17:20,641 --> 00:17:21,410
Okay

276
00:17:21,451 --> 00:17:23,067
Well, here I go

277
00:17:23,755 --> 00:17:25,071
Be careful!

278
00:17:27,121 --> 00:17:29,412
I don't know why, but I'm kind of worried

279
00:17:46,483 --> 00:17:48,500
The Snake-Headed Monster turned it like this

280
00:17:48,771 --> 00:17:50,713
It must be nearby

281
00:18:00,682 --> 00:18:02,454
Snake-Headed Monster, where are you?

282
00:18:03,598 --> 00:18:05,171
Come out!

283
00:18:16,871 --> 00:18:18,082
Th-That sound is...

284
00:18:18,122 --> 00:18:19,702
It's the Snake-Headed Monster's voice!

285
00:18:19,743 --> 00:18:21,291
Don't tell me Doraemon...

286
00:18:21,588 --> 00:18:22,431
Let's go

287
00:18:24,696 --> 00:18:25,617
Wait!

288
00:18:25,978 --> 00:18:27,347
Wait for me!

289
00:18:33,932 --> 00:18:35,053
Doraemon!

290
00:18:36,702 --> 00:18:38,362
Doraemon failed!

291
00:18:39,453 --> 00:18:40,943
The mirror broke!

292
00:18:42,182 --> 00:18:42,935
This way

293
00:18:42,975 --> 00:18:45,353
we won't be able to reflect the Snake-Headed Monster's beam

294
00:18:45,533 --> 00:18:47,436
If Doraemon has turned into stone

295
00:18:47,501 --> 00:18:49,551
we can't ask him to take out any gadgets

296
00:18:49,941 --> 00:18:51,629
This is bad!

297
00:18:52,551 --> 00:18:53,808
Hey, Suneo!

298
00:18:53,993 --> 00:18:55,225
What's the point of running away like this?

299
00:18:55,266 --> 00:18:57,609
I'm going home!

300
00:18:58,725 --> 00:19:01,093
Running home isn't going to help!

301
00:19:01,456 --> 00:19:02,923
You're so annoying!

302
00:19:05,068 --> 00:19:06,307
Suneo!

303
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:10,459
I can't turn to stone here!

304
00:19:25,767 --> 00:19:26,789
Damn it!

305
00:19:26,829 --> 00:19:28,658
Suneo turned to stone too!

306
00:19:28,882 --> 00:19:31,719
What do we do? There's only two of us left

307
00:19:31,792 --> 00:19:32,909
We have no choice

308
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:34,523
It's up to us now

309
00:19:35,233 --> 00:19:36,380
That's right, Gian!

310
00:19:36,421 --> 00:19:37,716
The Snake-Headed Monster's box!

311
00:19:37,756 --> 00:19:40,829
Oh no, I left it back there!

312
00:19:41,583 --> 00:19:43,155
We have to hurry back and get it!

313
00:19:43,196 --> 00:19:43,828
Yeah!

314
00:19:55,414 --> 00:19:57,398
Alright, as long as we have this box...

315
00:19:58,131 --> 00:19:58,737
Whoa!

316
00:19:59,349 --> 00:20:00,331
Nobita!

317
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:03,724
Wait for me!

318
00:20:07,967 --> 00:20:09,270
No way...

319
00:20:17,013 --> 00:20:18,148
Nobita!

320
00:20:18,693 --> 00:20:19,935
Gian!

321
00:20:22,302 --> 00:20:23,105
Nobita!

322
00:20:41,309 --> 00:20:42,303
Gian!

323
00:20:42,577 --> 00:20:43,924
Gian!

324
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:48,370
You turned to stone too?

325
00:20:50,279 --> 00:20:51,743
What should I do?

326
00:20:52,749 --> 00:20:54,889
Now I'm the only one left

327
00:21:00,264 --> 00:21:01,234
Nobita!

328
00:21:03,633 --> 00:21:06,025
Shizuka, why are you here?

329
00:21:06,249 --> 00:21:08,982
I came here to do my sketching homework

330
00:21:09,063 --> 00:21:11,227
You can't stay here any longer!

331
00:21:15,863 --> 00:21:17,432
What happened?

332
00:21:17,992 --> 00:21:19,604
We have to get out of here right away!

333
00:21:29,921 --> 00:21:31,391
If we just go through here...

334
00:21:41,644 --> 00:21:42,971
No, Shizuka!

335
00:21:47,238 --> 00:21:48,691
Shizuka!

336
00:21:55,750 --> 00:21:58,223
Come out, Snake-Headed Monster!

337
00:21:58,646 --> 00:22:01,179
Turn everyone back right now!

338
00:22:19,212 --> 00:22:21,033
My... my legs gave out...

339
00:22:24,899 --> 00:22:26,759
H-Help me!

340
00:22:27,857 --> 00:22:29,119
Help me!

341
00:22:32,379 --> 00:22:33,865
Ouch!

342
00:22:36,597 --> 00:22:38,457
That's it, I'll use this box

343
00:22:47,972 --> 00:22:50,348
Put this box right over it from above

344
00:22:58,091 --> 00:22:59,929
I'm falling...

345
00:23:14,750 --> 00:23:15,719
Huh?

346
00:23:16,058 --> 00:23:17,530
Whoa, just like that?

347
00:23:27,196 --> 00:23:28,844
It's over

348
00:23:29,275 --> 00:23:30,309
Nobita!

349
00:23:31,333 --> 00:23:32,988
What happened?

350
00:23:33,155 --> 00:23:34,946
Thank goodness!

351
00:23:39,171 --> 00:23:42,050
Huh? When did it become evening?

352
00:23:42,814 --> 00:23:44,486
What did I just...

353
00:23:47,018 --> 00:23:49,176
Did Nobita solve this all by himself?

354
00:23:49,356 --> 00:23:51,366
How on earth did he catch it?

355
00:23:51,930 --> 00:23:53,814
It's truly a mystery

356
00:23:53,990 --> 00:23:55,111
You kids!

357
00:23:56,948 --> 00:23:59,414
Have you finished the homework I gave you?

358
00:23:59,547 --> 00:24:00,985
I've already finished it!

359
00:24:01,026 --> 00:24:02,066
I'm done too!

360
00:24:02,106 --> 00:24:03,080
What about you, Nobita?

361
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:05,287
I haven't finished yet

362
00:24:05,657 --> 00:24:07,040
Doraemon!

363
00:24:07,081 --> 00:24:08,547
If you get made to stand in the hallway tomorrow

364
00:24:08,587 --> 00:24:10,182
just use the Snake-Headed Monster again

365
00:24:10,654 --> 00:24:12,685
How could you say that?
